Z||000000||Orville||12-18-2000||09:33 PM||||Okay, I'm a masochist. Here are some pictures<BR>of another fiero I modified. It is/was a '87<BR>GT. The drivetrain is stock 2.8 with getrag.<BR>It was shown by Phill Huff in the FOCOA news-<BR>letter about about a year ago (I'm a member).<BR>So if you've seen it there you'll remember.<BR>I modified these fieros only as one-off<BR>experiments and don't intend that a fiero<BR>should necessarily look like them. And I<BR>really appreciate your feedback - approving<BR>or disapproving.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mod1side2_2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mod1rqtr_2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mod1r1_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mod1frt2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
