Z||000002||sqoach||12-18-2000||09:53 PM||||i agree with rae<P>------------------<BR>sQoaCh<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig_2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Nashco||12-18-2000||09:57 PM||||I think that thing has some awesome potential Orville!  I really like the smoothed looks, and that front end looks killer in my opinion.  I am worried about airflow with the front, as we all know there is a lot to be desired with flow there as it is.  The back looks pretty trick, and I think with the lit up Pontiac letters, like the late GT's came with, that would look awesome as well.<P>Finish it all off with a couple inches drop, some 17's and low profile tires, and you'd have a very sweet ride.<P>Hopefully there's more in store for this project, because I think it's an awesome start!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||14
