Z||000010||Black88GT||12-18-2000||10:26 PM||||The back doesn't look too bad, maybe if the circles were glass instead of that mesh covering, makes it look like outdoor speaker covers or something.  Or like Supra tail lights (sorry PBS!)<P>Not too sure about the front, think I would need more pics.  You must be pretty talented to do all this...<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
